@baseUrl = http://localhost:5020
@supplierId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@variantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
@version = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006

# Requires an authenticated Admin or Warehouse session.

### Create a draft supplier order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "{{supplierId}}",
  "orderDate": "2026-10-24T00:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Ordine della collezione autunno",
  "lines": [
    { "articleVariantId": "{{variantId}}", "quantityOrdered": 24, "unitCost": "12.34567890" }
  ]
}

### List supplier orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders?openOnly=true

### Read order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}

### Confirm order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": "{{version}}" }

### Compare ordered quantities with confirmed supplier receipts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/reconciliation

### Downloadable shortage data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/shortages

### Create supplier return draft from selected surplus receipt lines
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/return-drafts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    { "supplierDeliveryNoteLineId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### List return drafts for the order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/return-drafts

### Read a return draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/return-drafts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008

### Issue a return draft; stock is decremented exactly once
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/return-drafts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": "{{version}}" }

### Close order accepting the reported differences
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/supplier-purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": "{{version}}" }
